<title>JAPAN: Fujicco to issue one mln new shares.</title>
<headline>Fujicco to issue one mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujicco Co Ltd said on Friday that it planned to issue one million new shares following its listing on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on December 27.</p>
<p>The manufacturer and retailer of seaweed and bean foodstuffs also said it would sell another one million shares that have already been issued.</p>
<p>Shares in the company are currently traded on the Osaka Securities Exchange.</p>
</text>
